Package: OmicSelector
Type: Package
Title: Rigorous Biomarker Discovery with Zero-Leakage Machine Learning
Version: 2.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Konrad", "Stawiski", , "konrad.stawiski@umed.lodz.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6550-3384")),
    person("Marcin", "Kaszkowiak", role = "aut"),
    person("Damian", "Mikulski", role = "aut"))
Description: A PhD-level toolkit for biomarker discovery from high-dimensional
    omics data. Enforces proper nested cross-validation with zero data leakage,
    computes feature stability metrics (Nogueira Stability Index), and provides
    multi-objective signature selection. Built on the mlr3 ecosystem for
    reproducible and scalable machine learning pipelines. Supports multi-omics
    integration, batch effect correction (FrozenComBat), model calibration,
    and SHAP-based interpretability.
